Domain Entity FunctionDimension
    documentation "The NCES function accounting dimension representing an expenditure. The function describes the activity for which a service or material object is acquired. The functions of a school district are generally classified into five broad areas, including instruction, support services, operation of non-instructional services, facilities acquisition and construction, and debt service."
    shared string Code
        documentation "The code representation of the account function dimension."
        is part of identity
    shared integer LocalFiscalYear named FiscalYear
        documentation "The fiscal year for which the account function dimension is valid."
        is part of identity
    shared string CodeName
        documentation "A description of the account function dimension."
        is optional
    descriptor ReportingTag
        documentation "Optional tag for accountability reporting."
        is optional collection
